    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772830/extras/fd58dff7da970547060513c2aabc473d.avif?t=1713089946\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span><br>Welcome to Vespera Hotel!<br><br>Please orbserve the precautions on manager's letter and greet our dear guests with your smile.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Description]</h2>Play as a Receptionist in Vespera Hotel. You will need to answer the calls and deal with their requests. You can take that old-fashioned lift to different floors where key items are located.<br><br>Press [E] to pick up items or talk to the guests.<br>Different choices will lead to different endings.<br><br>Press [T] to check your target when you are lost.<br><br>*Jump Scare WARNING*<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Controller Support]</h2><br>*You can now play this game with controller<br>*Press [View button] to view the Controller layout at any time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772830/extras/d9e167a741f94c4ac14f6a3891119d59.avif?t=1713089946\" width=568 height=356 /></span>",
